<!-- Bootstrap Alert Box

alert = Bootstrap alert component.

alert-danger = Red colored error box.

col-6 = Uses 6 columns out of 12.

offset-3 = Leaves 3 columns on the left.

Result: -->
<!-- The alert appears in the center. -->